-- Matcher **dialect v2** adds: `struct $NAME`, `method $NAME($ARGS)`, `const $NAME`, `enum $NAME` (plus v1 patterns). Invalid pattern → abort.
-- **`code_impact`** — additive blast-radius Impact Analysis; does not replace `code_get_*`.
