 [ ] 1. Load artifacts + pass gates
 [ ] 2. Mechanical move + diff -r readback
 [ ] 3. Ticket close-out (when Ticket set) + archive commit
 [ ] 4. Optional finish-branch + Mnemonic learnings
 [ ] 5. Persist archive-report + envelope
 ```
 
